Cell["For an ideal 1 nF capacitor, the impedance Bode plot is:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.792760621922182*^9, 3.792760633028642*^9}, {
  3.792764014710809*^9, 3.792764023743045*^9}, {3.792765482844217*^9, 
