Cell[TextData[{
 "Note that this 680 nF capacitor behaves as an ideal 680 nF capacitor from \
10 Hz to 100 kHz. It would therefore be suitable for use in an audio system \
circuit. It starts to depart from the ideal behavior above 100 kHz.\n",
