Cell["\<\
The Henry (H) is the unit of inductance. The symbol L and circuit symbol \
shown above are often used in reference to inductors. The image shows a 1 mH \
inductor with a ferrite core.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7927597952840147`*^9, 3.792759807179938*^9}, {
  3.792759871834964*^9, 3.792759880978839*^9}, {3.792759988735905*^9, 
