3215f70d125c"],

Cell["\<\
Lets consider a resistor (R), a capacitor (C) and an inductor (L) all in \
series. The electrical impedance of a circuit consisting of R, C, and L \
components in series is simply given by the sum of the individual component \
impedance transfer functions. So for the circuit above we get:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7927703742969356`*^9, 3.792770411714717*^9}, {
  3.792770466964451*^9, 3.7927705033061085`*^9}, {3.792784978121497*^9, 
  3.792784999219279*^9}, {3.7927850947300763`*^9, 3.792785171249926*^9}, {
  3.792785239540993*^9, 
  3.7927852432003536`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8cd39706-8050-4f59-ace4-\
bacf787c2206"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  ButtonBox["\<\"\[GraySquare]\"\>",
   Appearance->"Frameless",
   ButtonFunction:>(SelectionMove[
      EvaluationCell[], All, TextLine]; SelectionEvaluate[
      EvaluationNotebook[]]),
   Evaluator->Automatic,
   Method->"Preemptive"], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"z", "[", "s_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"resR", " ", "+", " ", 
    FractionBox["1", 
     RowBox[{"capC", " ", "s"}]], "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"indL", " ", "s"}]}]}], " ", ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.792770534094687*^9, 3.792770582182107*^9}, {
   3.792770920434224*^9, 3.792770920444298*^9}, 3.792771281001727*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[22]:=",ExpressionUUID->"18fdc92a-54e5-43a0-a1ee-88643db324da"],

Cell["If we set the resistance, capacitance and inductance to:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.792770590588015*^9, 
  3.792770622397064*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4d3aa58-02e0-4174-9c5d-\
719bba22ae54"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["\<\"\[GraySquare]\"\>",
    Appearance->"Frameless",
    ButtonFunction:>(SelectionMove[
       EvaluationCell[], All, TextLine]; SelectionEvaluate[
       EvaluationNotebook[]]),
    Evaluator->Automatic,
    Method->"Preemptive"], ";", " ", 
   RowBox[{"resR", "=", "1"}], " ", ";", "   ", 
   RowBox[{"capC", "=", 
    RowBox[{"680", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox["10", 
      RowBox[{"-", "9"}]]}]}], ";", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"indL", "=", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "3"}]]}], ";"}], " "}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.792770631586937*^9, 3.792770708792121*^9}, 
   3.792771278127737*^9, {3.7927713239153814`*^9, 3.792771350258509*^9}, {
   3.7928349224450865`*^9, 3.792834923551645*^9}, {3.797679932235054*^9, 
