Cell["\<\
Use the supplied breadboard and patch cables to connect the 10 k\
\[CapitalOmega] resistor in series with a parallel connection of the 650 nF \
capacitor and 1 mH inductor as shown above and measure the impedance Gain and \
Phase over the frequency range and other settings (note the 2001 Steps \
required to see clearly the central peak in impedance) shown below:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951239886636448*^9, 
  3.95123996678016*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8b580532-4875-420c-8db1-\
61197e914b04"],

